            "review_title": "Review at Danang Food Center",
            "review_text": "Georgia\n1 contribution\n0\nWorst service ever - Viet Com (bottom restaurant) of food centre\nJul 2019 • Family\nThe staff were very slow, unfriendly and unable to understand any English. We were the only ones in the restaurant and the food took a long time to be made. They didn’t bring one of our meals out and when we asked about it, they then said it was unavailable. They then re-made a dish we had already received and argued for us to pay for it. Very unaccommodating and rude. We never write reviews, but wanting to help people thinking of eating here in future.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 31, 2019",
