            "review_title": "Review at Danang Food Center",
            "review_text": "wilsonhocw\nSingapore, Singapore3723 contributions\n0\nDFC Danang Food Centre - Best Spot to view the weekend Dragon Bridge 9pm light show\nJul 2017 • Friends\n2nd floor restaurant of the DFC Danang Food Centre, besides Danang Riverside Hotel, is the best spot to view the weekend Sat/Sun 9pm Dragon Bridge light show.\n\nWe were surprised the food was delicious as this is more a touristy place instead of a proper restaurant. It was full-house when we were there on a Saturday night as there were loads of local tourists viewing the Dragon Bridge breathing fire and water light show.. !\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2017",
